{"product":{"id":"SKU-2609353370","identification":{"name":"PROGARDEN Gartenbank Genziana 2-Sitzer - Wetterfest & Pflegeleicht","brand":"PROGARDEN","category":"Gartenbank","sku":"SKU-2609353370","barcodes":[]},"details":{"identifiers":{"sku":"SKU-2609353370","ean":"","gtin":""},"images":[{"url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/progarden-genziana-001/other_f40be1a540d85f8f8d57143dfb5b73eb.png","source":"baselinker"},{"url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/progarden-genziana-001/other_dbf781abf2dcda73b492942e8fdbb469.png","source":"baselinker"},{"url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/progarden-genziana-001/other_53ed1dd66d28af31ab24d143f8bf1218.png","source":"baselinker"},{"url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/progarden-genziana-001/other_39cc3800115d98c9c40991a27ace05f4.png","source":"baselinker"},{"url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/progarden-genziana-001/other_261b1794109166df8f5348c85bff4747.png","source":"baselinker"},{"url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/progarden-genziana-001/other_c5cce5ca61142f81d44a36a6fab84280.png","source":"baselinker"}],"attributes":{"Marke":"PROGARDEN","Modell":"Genziana","Produkttyp":"Gartenbank","Sitzplätze":"2 Personen","Material":"Polypropylen (PP)","Farbe":"Anthrazit","Herstellungsland":"Italien","Länge":"110 cm","Breite":"52 cm","Höhe":"71 cm","Gewicht":"8,6 kg","Maximale Belastbarkeit":"120 kg pro Sitzplatz","Art der Montage":"Steck- und Schraubverbindungen","Lieferzustand":"Zerlegt","text_features|de|ebay_9800: Marke":"PROGARDEN","text_features|de|ebay_9800: Modell":"Genziana","text_features|de|ebay_9800: Farbe":"Weiß","text_features|de|ebay_9800: Produkttyp":"Gartenbank","text_features|de|ebay_9800: Herstellernummer":"SKU-2609353370","_id":"prod-genziana-bench-1","eBay-Kategorie":"Haus & Garten > Garten & Terrasse > Gartenmöbel-Sets & -Einzelteile > Gartenbänke","eBay-Item-Specifics: Besonderheiten":"Wetterfest, UV-beständig, Pflegeleicht","eBay-Item-Specifics: Montage erforderlich":"Ja","Kaufland-Kategorie":"Garten & Freizeit > Gartenmöbel > Gartenbänke","Kaufland-Attribute: Breite":"110 cm","Kaufland-Attribute: Tiefe":"52 cm","GPSR Manufacturer name":"PROGARDEN","GPSR Manufacturer address":"Not Provided, EU","GPSR Manufacturer email":"info@example.com"},"description":"Die PROGARDEN Gartenbank Genziana bietet zwei bequeme Sitzplätze und verwandelt Terrasse, Balkon oder Garten in eine gemütliche Ruhezone. Ihre kompakte Form nutzt kleine Außenbereiche optimal aus und schafft schnell zusätzliche Sitzgelegenheiten.

