{"product":{"createdAt":"2025-12-12T21:34:13.118Z","quantity":1,"identification":{"name":"UBRAVOO Kindersitzerhöhung faltbar – Sicher & Komfortabel am Familientisch","category":"Kindersitze","sku":"SKU-0362404564","brand":"UBRAVOO","barcodes":[]},"id":"UBRAVOO-ACE1013-1","updatedAt":"2025-12-12T21:34:13.118Z","ops":{"sync_status":"pending","last_saved_iso":"2025-12-14T11:48:06.900Z","revision":3,"updated_at_iso":"2025-12-14T11:54:25.015Z","identity_key":"identity:b6cf8559063a65b8e674e31e","identity_aliases":["ubravoo ace1013 1","sku 0362404564","ubravoo","kindersitze","kindersitzerhohung faltbar sicherer booster mit flamingo design","ubravoo::kindersitzerhohung faltbar sicherer booster mit flamingo design","kindersitzerhohung faltbar sicherer booster flamingo design","kindersitzerhohung faltbar sicherer booster","booster-design-faltbar-flamingo-kindersitzerhohung-sicherer","kindersitzerhohung","faltbar","sicherer","booster","flamingo","design"],"pending_intake_quantity":0},"details":{"identifiers":{"ean":null,"sku":"SKU-0362404564"},"description":"Die UBRAVOO Kindersitzerhöhung ACE1013 bietet Ihrem Kind eine sichere, erhöhte Sitzposition am Esstisch zuhause oder unterwegs. Dank integriertem 3-Punkt-Gurt sitzt Ihr Nachwuchs stabil und gut gehalten während der Mahlzeiten.

