{"product":{"createdAt":"2025-12-12T21:34:12.718Z","quantity":1,"identification":{"name":"Unbekannt Handpan Schwarz – Tief beruhigende Klänge für Meditation & Yoga","category":"Schlaginstrumente","sku":"SKU-4212491486","brand":"Unbekannt","barcodes":[]},"id":"unknown-ean-1","updatedAt":"2025-12-12T21:34:12.718Z","ops":{"sync_status":"pending","last_saved_iso":"2025-12-13T16:47:59.061Z","revision":3,"updated_at_iso":"2025-12-13T16:49:46.636Z","identity_key":"identity:e352eff30b9ece8eb1a02b84","identity_aliases":["unknown ean 1","sku 4212491486","unbekannt","schlaginstrumente","handpan schwarz warmer klang fur meditation und yoga","unbekannt::handpan schwarz warmer klang fur meditation und yoga","handpan schwarz warmer klang meditation yoga","handpan schwarz warmer klang","handpan-klang-meditation-schwarz-warmer-yoga","handpan","schwarz","warmer","klang","meditation","yoga"],"pending_intake_quantity":0},"details":{"identifiers":{"ean":null,"sku":"SKU-4212491486"},"description":"Diese Handpan mit neun Noten erzeugt einen warmen, klaren Klang für Meditation, Yoga und Klangtherapie. Die harmonische Stimmung fördert tiefe Entspannung, Achtsamkeit und kreativen musikalischen Ausdruck.

Der Korpus besteht aus lackiertem Stahl mit matter schwarzer Oberfläche und ist robust sowie pflegeleicht. Präzise eingearbeitete Tonfelder ermöglichen ein intuitives Spiel mit den Händen oder den beiliegenden Schlägeln, ideal für Einsteiger und Fortgeschrittene.

Im Lieferumfang enthalten sind die Handpan, zwei Schlägel und eine gepolsterte Tragetasche mit komfortablen Tragegurten. Für eine lange Lebensdauer sollte das Instrument trocken gelagert, regelmäßig mit einem weichen Tuch gereinigt und der Kontakt mit aggressiven Reinigungsmitteln vermieden werden.","attributes":{"Marke":"Unbekannt","Produkttyp":"Handpan","Farbe":"Schwarz","Material":"Metall","eBay-Kategoriepfad":"Musikinstrumente > Schlaginstrumente > Handpans","Kaufland-Kategoriepfad":"Musikinstrumente & Zubehör > Schlaginstrumente > Handpans","ebay_category_id":"37976","ebay_category_path":"Schlaginstrumente","kaufland_category_id":"53581","kaufland_category_path":"Schlaginstrumente","GPSR Manufacturer name":"Unbekannt","GPSR Manufacturer address":"Not Provided, EU","GPSR Manufacturer email":"info@example.com"},"pricing":{"lowest_price":{"amount":179,"currency":"EUR","sources":[{"name":"Anbieterinformation","url":"","price":179,"shipping":0,"checked_at":"2024-07-30T10:00:00Z"}],"last_checked_iso":"2024-07-30T10:00:00Z"},"price_confidence":0.8},"images":[{"source":"upload","variant":"other","url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/unknown-ean-1/other_5263a0b0de93dd25705f69b82fc38398.png","notes":"other_5263a0b0de93dd25705f69b82fc38398.png"},{"source":"upload","variant":"other","url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/unknown-ean-1/other_dc42dc2d36203c4f6110786e01c93569.png","notes":"other_dc42dc2d36203c4f6110786e01c93569.png"},{"source":"upload","variant":"other","url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/unknown-ean-1/other_fbd454f665589b73a7a2c4711f4c1761.png","notes":"other_fbd454f665589b73a7a2c4711f4c1761.png"},{"source":"upload","variant":"other","url_or_base64":"https://storage.googleapis.com/avycloud-product-images/products/unknown-ean-1/other_c0d83ba9b9fa30df515a6b6948e362bf.png","notes":"other_c0d83ba9b9fa30df515a6b6948e362bf.png"},{"sourc